--- !u!114 &92059671
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 92059667}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Is that\u2026 The same voice changer that some kid used to call Jack?"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 1787885774}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "What if it wasn\u2019t a kid? (Torch adjusts a couple knobs and the voice
      sounds a little sharper - it\u2019s definitely an adult, a high pitched female)"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'The voice says,

      "Progress report?"'
    name: Mysterious Voice
    character: {fileID: 413536891}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"The tunnels are almost complete, Agent R. We have hazmat suits ready
      just in case. The sword is so close I can taste it\u2026 I assume you\u2019re
      holding up your end of the bargain?\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Indeed, I\u2019ve been feeding information to the Hero. If my intel
      is correct, he has already infiltrated the rival dojo and seen inside their
      tunnels\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"He\u2019s\u2026 Real? The prophecy is\u2026.\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: '"You act so surprised"'
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: '"I know, I know. Trust the Agent, and trust no one else"'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Of course the Hero is real, because I made him real. We don\u2019t just
      idly wait for our prophecies to come true - we engineer them. He did most of
      the work, really. All I had to do was bring him here and give him a little
      nudge\""
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Do you really think he can go through with it and change the world?
      You don\u2019t think.. The ninjas have gotten to his head?\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Trust me, he has the motive. I had one of my operatives track down his
      father, and although I didn\u2019t give explicit orders to kill\u2026\""
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: Oh. My. God. You MONSTER!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: "And I thought Chrome Dome was bad\u2026"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 730818676}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: "Torch, you can\u2019t, like, geolocate these Porta-Comms, can you?"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1666912475}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "(Torch shakes his head) Shh.. Keep listening\u2026"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 2110639715}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"An unfortunate mistake. They say Spartans have no regrets about killing,
      but... (She sighs). This is not about me - tactically this is the best move
      we could\u2019ve made. Spartan Jack will open the gate to the spirit world,
      it\u2019s only a matter of time. We don\u2019t just engineer the prophecies,
      we cause the motives too.\""
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"You\u2019re so.. Cunning. You know, I spent so long wondering who this
      Agent was before you reached out\u2026 You\u2019re exactly what I imagined
      and more, Agent R\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: '"Such a good minion. And when the end time comes, you will become my right
      hand man"'
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"When the fighting is over, I hope I\u2019ll be seeing your face\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: '"Will you bring me flowers? "

'
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Oh.. Crap\u2026 Someone\u2019s at our door. A group of kids from that
      dojo. Code orange!\""
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\"Destroy this phone. I\u2019ll see you on the Solstice. Godspeed, Spartan\""
    name: Agent R
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: "\u2026"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "I\u2019m\u2026 So sorry, man"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 1787885774}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "I hate to say this but\u2026 Is this voice right? Are you trying to use
      Khan to bring your father back?"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 730818676}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I.. I don\u2019t know. Is that possible?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I\u2026 don\u2019t know either"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 730818676}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "But it\u2019s worth a try, right? Anything is worth a try"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Is it worth the end of the world?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1666912475}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "(You glare at Storm as an overwhelming rage courses through your body.
      How could she say such a thing, after learning your father was brutally murdered
      for\u2026 what\u2026 seemingly nothing?)"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Angry
  - text: "IS IT WORTH THE END OF THE WORLD? Y\u2019KNOW WHAT, STORM? MAYBE IT IS."
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 263287907}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
