--- !u!114 &1839486714
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1839486704}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: You better not go waving that thing around, that rival dojo has their panties
      in a bunch trying to get their hands on one
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "Storm and Stretch told me it wasn\u2019t very special\u2026 It was kind
      of insulting, actually"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Pssht, how many ninjas and Spartans have you been attacked by in the past
      week?

'
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: (You begin counting, but run out of fingers pretty quick)
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Happy
  - text: "Exactly. That thing is a hot commodity. Now show me what you\u2019ve got.
      C\u2019mon now, don\u2019t hold back. Do the thingy on our old friend BOB\u2026"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: I should just.. (You hold up the blade to your hand) This still feels so
      wrong
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "You\u2019re pathetic"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: OH YEAH?
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Cut
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Angry
  - text: (The sword begins to shudder and jump, bend and buckle. It seems to whine
      at the thought of being used for entertainment)
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Happy
  - text: 'THIS...

      IS....

      SPARTAAAAA!!!!'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: CraneKick
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
--- !u!114 &1839486715
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1839486704}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: AND STAY DOWN!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Sheath
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "Um, Jack\u2026 Hate to break it to you, but Bob\u2019s head is still on
      his shoulders\u2026"
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "I was monitoring your energy with this magnetometer - I\u2019m sorry,
      I have a thing for gadgets - and.. I hate to say it but that sword doesn\u2019t
      even register."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: Phone
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I\u2019d say it has one soul, tops. Maybe two. But like, if those two
      were both midgets."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Not you too\u2026"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "The weird part is, the sword shouldn\u2019t have any power at all. My
      mom made it herself as part of this self-help blacksmithing retreat."
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Wow, your mom is.. kinda metal, man
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "That\u2019s one way to put it, I guess. Ugh. Is it true that swords only
      get power when they claim lives, or are passed down through generations of
      powerful warriors?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Hmmph. What did you say happened to your dad?
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: None of your business, man
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Angry
  - text: "Five bucks says a part of him is in that sword. And if I were you, I\u2019d
      listen to it."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: "L\u2026 Listen to it?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: What is it telling you?
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Well, the moment I got close to overhearing a conversation about some
      sort of secret weapon, it pulled me closer\u2026 And another time, when Storm
      stole it away from me, it came back\u2026 "
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'It wants... Or, rather.. He wants...

      He wants me to keep investigating.

      He
      wants me to find whatever they''re keeping in that dojo'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "Maybe it\u2019s not the sword they\u2019re after. Maybe it\u2019s\u2026
      you? Chew on that for a bit. Smoke it. Snort up that knowledge, whatever you\u2019re
      into, man. Nice talk, I\u2019m glad I had you over."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "Let\u2019s keep in touch, or whatever - Have a coke on the way out. Send
      me any cool gear you find and I\u2019ll give you more. A real man\u2019s soda,
      not whatever hippie dippie sludge Thad thinks is cool."
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: 'And, on the down low...

      Don''t go back home. They''re watching.
      Stick to the shadows.'
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1828885413}
    pose: CasualLean
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Wow, that''s not ominous at all...

      Sayonara, friend!'
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 796600113}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
